      <p class="text-gray-300">TurnKey Internet is one of the longest-running independent VPS providers in North America, founded in 1999 and family-owned since then. The company runs its own green data center in Latham, New York, powered by 100% renewable energy since 2012. VPS plans start at $7.95/mo for a 1 vCPU / 1GB / 25GB SSD instance, with full KVM root access. The trade-off: only one datacenter location, and a higher price floor than budget hosts like RackNerd or Vultr.</p>
